---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Projects | Jorge" lang="en">
  

  <main>
    <h1>Projects</h1>
     <p class="lead">A selection of personal and academic projects.</p>
     <hr class="hr" />

   <section>
  <h2>Personal Projects</h2>

  <div class="grid">
    <details>
      <summary class="project-summary">
        <div class="summary-left">
          <img
           class="project-logo"
           src="/images/wallstreet.webp"
           alt="Website Logo"
         />
         <span>Website development</span>
       </div>

       <span class="chev">▾</span>
     </summary>

      <p>
        I was able to develop a financial outreach blog developed
        alongside a colleague, with the aim of explaining financial concepts in
        a clear and accessible way. For over a year we maintained a constant
        production of content focused on markets, investment, and economic
        fundamentals.
      </p>
      <p>
        Despite competing with established financial media and platforms like
        Rankia or major newspapers, we managed to rank over 20 articles within
        the top 5 Google search results. The project demanded long-term
        consistency, strategic content planning, and continuous optimization.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary class="project-summary">
        <div class="summary-left">
          <img
           class="project-logo"
           src="/images/espetup.webp"
           alt="Espet-Up Logo"
         />
         <span>Espet-Up</span>
        </div>
        <span class="chev">▾</span>
      </summary>
      <p>
        Espet-Up is a student organization focused on entrepreneurship and
        innovation in the area of Málaga, where I served as co-founder. This initiative comes from the lack of communication of opportunities related to entrepreneurship and innovation at the local level.
      </p>
      <img
        class="project-photo"
        src="/images/evento-hackathon.jpg"
        alt="Espet-Up Hackathon event"
      />
      <p>
        Through Espet-Up, we seek to create a space for knowledge sharing and active participation, working towards higher visibility of the entrepreneurship ecosystem. This project has reinforced my interest in entrepreneurship, coordinating initiatives and community building.
      </p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Academic Projects</h2>

  <div class="grid">
    <details>
      <summary class="project-summary">
        <div class="summary-left">
             <span class="project-icon">🏠</span>
             <span>Housing Market Analysis (Microeconomics)</span>
        </div>

        <span class="chev">▾</span>
      </summary>
      <p>
        This project analyzed the current housing market from a microeconomic
        perspective...
      </p>
      <a
      class="file-link"
      href="/files/housing_market.pdf"
      target="_blank"
    >
      📥 Housing Market Analysis (PDF)
     </a>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary class="project-summary">
        <div class="summary-left">
             <span class="project-icon">📊</span>
             <span>Several Macroeconomics class Projects</span>
        </div>

        <span class="chev">▾</span>
     </summary>

     <p>
        During the Macroeconomics course, I completed several class projects
        covering key topics such as exchange rates, inflation, unemployment,
        and sovereign bond yield curves. These projects helped me gain a deeper
        understanding of macroeconomic concepts and their practical application
        in the real economy.
     </p>

     <div class="files-list">
    <a
      class="file-link"
      href="/files/Eur_vs_Usd.xlsx"
      target="_blank"
    >
      📥 EUR vs USD — Exchange rate analysis (Excel)
    </a>

    <a
      class="file-link"
      href="/files/great_trade_collapse.xlsx"
      target="_blank"
    >
      📥 Great Trade Collapse — Trade data (Excel)
    </a>

    <a
      class="file-link"
      href="/files/UK.xlsx"
      target="_blank"
    >
      📥 UK Macroeconomic indicators (Excel)
    </a>

    <a
      class="file-link"
      href="/files/yielding-curve-task.docx"
      target="_blank"
    >
      📥 Yield Curve Analysis — Assignment (DOCX)
    </a>
     </details>
     </div>
   </section>
 </main>
</BaseLayout>
